On openKylin, users can adjust virtual keyboard settings such as
size, animation, and autostart through the control center.
However, this functionality is not available on other distributions.
This patch adds settings menu items to the tray icon context menu to provide these configuration options for users on other distributions:

- Autostart toggle
- Animation toggle
- Keyboard size submenu (20%-100%)
- Tray icon visibility submenu
